    "enUS": {
      "description": "Digging through the mound, you find a small, dirt-stained book.\n\nThe book has no title, but...it has information Sven would like to know.",
      "dialogue": {
        "05bb1e0a2782480fe2c4": "You found what??  Please, let me see it...",
        "8fa0e0d21ebba3417139": "<Sven reads the book's pages, then slams it shut.>$B$BThat shadowy figure I saw was a witness to my family's death!  There are questions I'd like to ask that man...if only I knew who he was!"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Book from Sven's Farm to Sven.",
      "title": "Sven's Camp",
